  "description": "Smart.Ports是一个统一的通信端口类库，提供了一致的接口来操作不同类型的通信端口，包括串口（SerialPort）、TCP客户端（TcpClient）、TCP服务端（TcpServer）和UDP节点（Udp）。该类库使用工厂模式简化端口创建，并通过继承关系提供特定端口类型的扩展功能。\n\t\t\tSmart.Ports is a unified communication port library that provides a consistent interface for operating different types of communication ports, including SerialPort, TcpClient, TcpServer, and Udp. The library uses the factory pattern to simplify port creation and provides extended functionality for specific port types through inheritance.",
